title: $:/ControlPanel/Settings/FileBackups/TestUpdate

---

!! Dev test affordance

''Beta-build only.'' These buttons inject a fake update notification into `storage.local.updateAvailable` so the toolbar badge and popup chip can be exercised without a live release. Stripped from stable builds by the build-time test-tiddler gate.

<$button>
<$action-setfield $tiddler="$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/test/inject-update" text="stable"/>
Test stable update
</$button>
&nbsp;
<$button>
<$action-setfield $tiddler="$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/test/inject-update" text="beta"/>
Test beta update
</$button>

---

!! Backup awareness settings

''Beta-build only.'' Inject sample global defaults (14 days, 30 files, 100 MB) into `storage.local`, then clear them, so the per-wiki ''Backup awareness'' fields above show their live "Global default" values without opening the AddOn options page.

<$button>
<$action-setfield $tiddler="$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/test/inject-awareness" text="sample"/>
Set sample defaults
</$button>
&nbsp;
<$button>
<$action-setfield $tiddler="$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/test/inject-awareness" text="off"/>
Clear defaults (off)
</$button>

---

!! Reminder injection

''Beta-build only.'' Inject a pending reminder so it appears where the AddOn really surfaces it: an in-page banner at the top of this wiki (popup chip + toolbar badge follow in stage 2). The value shown is the current global default for that kind, or a sample if it is off, so set sample defaults above to see real numbers. ''Clear'' removes them.

<$button><$action-setfield $tiddler="$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/test/inject-reminder" text="milestone"/>Milestone reminder</$button>
&nbsp;
<$button><$action-setfield $tiddler="$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/test/inject-reminder" text="count"/>File-count reminder</$button>
&nbsp;
<$button><$action-setfield $tiddler="$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/test/inject-reminder" text="size"/>Size reminder</$button>
&nbsp;
<$button><$action-setfield $tiddler="$:/temp/plugins/file-backups/test/inject-reminder" text="clear"/>Clear reminders</$button>
